# Adjacent data surfaces

- Use docs, similar markets, candles, public snapshots, exports, and
  news only when capability status marks them live.
- `news/latest` is live. Pull it with `scripts/news-latest.py`, or
  supply article JSON, then rank with `scripts/news-correlation.py`.
- `indices/{id}/correlation` is unavailable. Regime analysis requires
  supplied JSON.
- Use mid-derived candle closes, never last trade, for tracking charts.
- Never invent endpoint responses.
